robotOS builds on work by others.

- ClawPTT (https://github.com/mthelpme/clawptt) and rabbit-r1-openclaw
  (https://github.com/mthelpme/rabbit-r1-openclaw): the R1 side-button facts (mtk-kpd scancode
  116, BUTTON_1 keylayout remap), the root evdev reader approach for presses that wake the screen,
  and the radio power-saver idea. app/src/main/java/dev/r1ptt/sys/Root.kt is adapted from
  ClawPTT's Root.kt. Both projects are under the MIT license:

